	(text "Button-activated Soil Moisture Meter  -  3xAAA (3.0-4.8V), no regulator\nIdle: MCU in power-down, TPS22917 off -> ~0.5 uA total.  Press SW1 -> PA6 wakes MCU ->\nLOAD_EN high -> VSW powers OLED + sensor -> ADC reads AOUT (PA5) -> display 15 s -> LOAD_EN low -> sleep."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "38a5d95e-5336-58d0-abec-5ee82439cec1")
	)
	(text "Firmware notes: run at 10 MHz (valid >2.7 V). Before LOAD_EN low, disable TWI and set\nPB0/PB1 to input w/o pull-up so the unpowered OLED/sensor aren't back-fed.\nSensor read ratiometric (ADC ref = VDD, sensor LDO bypassed). Battery: VDD vs. internal reference.\nOLED module runs from VSW via its own LDO (3.3-5V). Low-batt cutoff ~3.3 V (1.1 V/cell)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cac2473c-01cf-5847-8a7c-4a63bbed6c72")
	)
